10:52:02  == Installing Chat Computer next to macOS
10:52:02  The Asahi installer makes room next to macOS and installs Chat Computer's base (Fedora Linux) there. Setup
10:52:02  answers its questions. When it asks for your Mac's password, type it (it stays hidden) and press Enter.
10:52:02  It takes about 10 to 20 minutes; your Mac may seem to freeze while macOS's partition shrinks. That's normal.
10:52:02  First, your Mac's password for setup itself:
